            <profile id="0137-aaeb-ef5a-0691" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="28aa-c13e-b61d-4f3e" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, throwing spear, javelins and shield. May have light armour (+3). On foot Fierce, Warband rules 1 and 2. The number of Pueri units is not limited, but each Pueri unit must be led by an Antrustio, Dux or Rex, who must remain with the unit (not enforced). (The Age of Arthur p.57)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
