  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="0515-45ef-3ea6-2500" name="Franks: Early Merovingian Franks (Age of Arthur) - List Notes" publicationId="28aa-c13e-b61d-4f3e" hidden="false">
      <description>THE FRANKS (The Age of Arthur, pp.55-58). An alternative to the Early Merovingian Franks list in Beyond the Golden Gate. Units of Pueri, Franci and Tribal Warriors may have a Leader (+5), Musician (+5) and Standard (+5). Allies are documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Franks: Early Merovingian Franks]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Common Warriors: at least 33%
  Uncommon Warriors: up to 25%
  EARLY MEROVINGIAN FRANKS (c.450-600). Characters up to 33% (Rex or Dux; advantages Angones et Franciscae, Fabricae, Finest Armour, Finest Horses (no cost), Hail of Blows, Loyalty, Mounted Raider, Veteran). Common warriors at least 33% (Pueri and Franci). Uncommon up to 25% (Tribal Warriors and Skirmishers). Allies up to 25% from one list: Saxons - The Sea Raiders (Geoguth led by 0-1 Atheling or 0-1 Thegn) or Romano-British Civitates - Brittany (Milites and Pedyt led by 0-1 Tribune or 0-1 Decurio).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
